                        "entry_id": "3612a12c-2bdc-32a0-8fe2-7a5d4bd9aa6e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "any movement of people; (specifically) a large number of simultaneous departures and arrivals in holiday seasons, often resulting in traffic congestion"
                        ],
